{
  "page_id": "BR-16",
  "section_header": "BRAKE SYSTEM — Front Brake",
  "title": "REMOVAL OF CYLINDER and DISASSEMBLY OF CYLINDER",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "REMOVAL OF CYLINDER"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(See page BR-14)"
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 1,
      "description": "Brake hose disconnection from brake tube and cylinder using SST tool and spanner",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 4,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "1.",
          "heading": "DISCONNECT BRAKE HOSE FROM BRAKE TUBE AND CYLINDER",
          "steps": [
            "(a) Using SST and a spanner, disconnect the brake tube from the hose.",
            {
              "type": "part_number",
              "label": "SST",
              "number": "09751-36011"
            },
            "(b) Use a container to catch the brake fluid.",
            "(c) Remove the clip from brake hose.",
            "(d) Disconnect the brake hose from the cylinder."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Brake cylinder assembly mounted on brake disc and torque plate",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 22,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 37
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "2.",
          "heading": "REMOVE CYLINDER",
          "steps": [
            "(a) Hold the sliding bushing and remove the cylinder installation bolt.",
            "(b) Lift up and push out the cylinder from the torque plate pin."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Hands removing cylinder installation bolt from brake assembly",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 40,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 4,
      "description": "Exploded view of brake cylinder components including anti-squeal shim, brake pads, anti-rattle springs, pad guide plates, and pad support plate",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 58,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "3.",
          "heading": "REMOVE FOLLOWING PARTS:",
          "steps": [
            "(a) Anti-squeal shim",
            "(b) Brake pads",
            "(c) Anti-rattle springs",
            "(d) Pad guide plates",
            "(e) Pad support plate"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
